    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d367">

                <pb facs="0376" n="260" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg260"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 839.51/1460.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Minister Sullivan.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-12-14T16:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 14, 1914, 4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your December 12, 3 p.m. Telegraphic instructions have been sent today to
                    Receivership to continue $5,000 daily until further notice. This is to be made
                    continuous so that there shall be no deduction on account of change of
                    administration.</p>
                <p>You are instructed to inform President Jiménez that on no account must this
                    amount be exceeded.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
